vestments 3.099) [Actual, Arithmetic, with overlap caveat from pack].\n- Interest coverage: no debt; N/A.\nJudgment: EXCELLENT.\nStep 2-5 Capital Allocation Scorecard:\n1. Buyback efficiency: 2/3 (share count flat, no aggressive buyback).\n2. M&A track record: 2/3 (undisclosed; no impairments but no transformative deals).\n3. Capex efficiency: 3/3 (incremental ROIC >20%; recent capex cycle in manufacturing).\n4. Rationality of mix: 3/3 (reinvests in R&D, manufacturing, international expansion).\n5. Guidance accuracy: 3/3 (Q1 and Q2 2026 beat estimates; FY guidance maintained or raised).\nInsider signals: CEO/mgmt ownership 0.51% [Actual vendor]: no bonus. Total: 13/15.\n\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\n\u25a0 SECTION 2.5. INTANGIBLES-ADJUSTED FINANCIALS\n--------------------------------\nStep 2.5-1 R&D Capitalization:\nR&D expense FY2025 \u2248 1.15B [Estimate \u2014 derived as ~11.4% of revenue, a figure not explicitly broken out in the pack; flagged [Unconfirmed] if mis-specified].\nCapitalizing R&D with 4-year straight-line amortization:\nAdjusted OI = 2.946 + 1.150 \u2212 1.050 \u2248 3.046B (+3.4% vs reported) [Estimate].\nStep 2.5-2 SBC:\nSBC FY2025 = 0.788B [Actual]. Adjusted FCF (cash-basis) = OCF 3.030 \u2212 capex 0.540 \u2212 SBC 0.788 = 1.702B [Arithmetic].\nThis is an important correction: the vendor FCF of 2.491B overstates owner cash earnings by 46%.\nStep 2.5-3 Operating Leases:\nOperating lease liabilities 0.171B [Actual]. Debt: effectively zero. Adjusted net debt = \u22129.03B + 0.17B = \u22128.86B [Arithmetic].\nStep 2.5-4 Brand/Data Asset:\nBrand value is meaningful but not separately P&L; data eco